身份随使节一行人前往魏国。","tc":"卑彌呼手下的千名侍女之一，六名被獻給魏明帝的生口之一，同行生口平清之姊。在妹妹平清提出貢獻邪馬臺子民后提出了反對，但因女王的決定只可應允，并請求作為生口兼護衛的身份隨使節一行人前往魏國。","en":"One of Himiko's thousand handmaidens, and one of six tribute captives offered to Emperor Ming of Wei, as well as the elder sister of her fellow tribute Hirasei. After her younger sister Hirasei proposed offering Yamatai subjects as tribute, she objected. However, as the queen's decision was absolute, she could only comply, requesting to accompany the envoy's party as both tribute and escort on the journey to Wei.","jp":"卑弥呼に仕える千人の侍女のひとりであり、魏の明帝に献上された六人の生口のひとり。同行した生口・平清の姉。妹の平清が邪馬台国の民を献上することを提案した際には反対したものの、女王の決定には従わざるを得ず、自ら生口兼護衛として使節団に同行し魏へ赴くことを願い出た。","kr":"히미코 수하의 천 명에 달하는 시녀 중 한 명이자 위명제에게 바쳐진 여섯 생구 중 한 사람으로, 동행한 생구 평청의 언니입니다. 여동생 평청이 야마타이의 백성을 바치자고 제안하자 이에 반대했으나 여왕의 결정이었기에 따를 수밖에 없었고, 생구 겸 호위의 신분으로 사절 일행을 따라 위나라로 향하기를 청했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ20135","remark":"","surname":"平","surnameTc":"平","surnameEn":"Ping","surnameJp":"平","surnameKr":"평","surnameOther":"","name":"媛","nameTc":"媛","nameEn":"Yuan","nameJp":"媛","nameKr":"원","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"平媛","power":"WJ11050","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"188","city":"CS1066","gender":"1","rule":"75","force":"80","wise":"70","politics":"43","charm":"81","will":"74","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"10","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"10","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"25/25/25/77/25/18/46/25","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1004800;1003500","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1004605","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5600","battleSoulPoint":"6400","debateSoulPoint":"4900","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"2/0